# The infinite-pm/ipm-tools ref that release.yml builds the bundled ipm-rpc
# server from. Blank lines and #-comments ignored; one ref (tag, branch or SHA).
#
# ci.yml deliberately does NOT read this — it builds against ipm-tools main so
# palette drift and API breaks surface on the next push, not at release time.
# Releases pin, so a tag is reproducible; the resolved SHA is recorded in the
# release notes either way. Move this to a tag once ipm-tools tags releases.
main
